# Nova Pentacle's ruling: "Whether it's still a legal target is not checked at this time. However, if ... it's no longer on
# the battlefield, then the damage is not redirected and is dealt to you as normal" (CR 614.9). Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at
# Bot1, who responds with the Pentacle; Bot2 targets Bot1's Sanctuary Cat, and as the ability resolves Bot1 chooses the Bolt
# on the stack as the source (CR 609.7a). Bot2 then kills the Cat with a second Bolt before the first resolves: its 3 damage
# to Bot1 has nowhere to go, and is dealt to Bot1 (17).

